Homepage: https://github.com/yourusername/appimage-autoinstaller

Package: appimage-autoinstaller
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, bash (>= 4.0)
Description: Automatic AppImage installer with systemd integration
 Automatically monitors a specified directory for AppImage files and installs
 them to a configured location. Extracts icons and creates desktop entries
 for seamless integration with your application launcher.
 .
 Features:
  - Automatic installation on file download/move
  - Manual sync command (appimage-sync)
  - Configurable watch and install directories
  - Systemd integration for zero overhead
  - Automatic icon and desktop entry creation
